he deployment caveat into a reference page that will outlive the stale process. But a reviewer testing against the live resident will see the opposite of what the page says, and should know why before concluding the page is wrong.\n\nGates at this exact head: gofmt silent, go build zero, go vet zero, go test ./... -count=1 with thirty-two packages ok and no failures, docset included in that run. Branch clean and pushed, origin equal.","body":{"commit":"fa8bc8afb86a94f8f3b6f0dea4111a6797288969","path":"docs/reference/gs/state.md"}}